  (text "Notes\nJ1: pin 1 +24 V, pin 2 0 V, pin 3 functional earth. Pluggable version to suit the enclosure\nF1: 1 A time-lag, rated 63 V DC or more. CHECK part\nD1: reverse-polarity protection\nD2: bidirectional TVS after the series diode; clamps about 53 V\nC1: bulk, aluminium electrolytic, 105 C\nU1: compensation and RT values to be confirmed with TI WEBENCH. CHECK\nR1: NOT FITTED. UVLO divider, not fitted: EN's internal pull-up enables the regulator\nR2: NOT FITTED.\nR3: about 600 kHz\nL1: CHECK saturation current >= 2.5 A\nD3: catch diode"
    (at 15.24 226.06 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid a4fc0c28-b2db-5256-9c1b-b5a3f4235d88)
